<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Station Casinos said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Station Casinos said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co downgraded Station Casinos Inc to market performer, market sources said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Analyst not available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed at 10-1/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
